00:00:48.261 --> 00:00:50.286
- Magic: The Gathering
is the world's premiere

00:00:50.286 --> 00:00:51.315
trading card game.

00:00:51.315 --> 00:00:53.141
It premiered back in 1993.

00:00:53.141 --> 00:00:55.430
Basically you bring a deck of
cards that you built yourself.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:57.456
You have 20 life, they have 20 life

00:00:57.456 --> 00:00:58.289
and if you can get them to zero

00:00:58.289 --> 00:01:00.027
before they get you to zero, you win.

00:01:00.027 --> 00:01:02.077
The game is now played
by millions of players

00:01:02.077 --> 00:01:03.060
around the world

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:04.708
and it's like no other
game really out there.

00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:06.723
- There's also really cool
story elements in the game.

00:01:06.723 --> 00:01:09.347
There's an entire lore,
there's characters.

00:01:09.347 --> 00:01:10.709
You can follow the character's story

00:01:10.709 --> 00:01:11.948
as we go through the sets.

00:01:11.948 --> 00:01:14.245
- I don't know what it is
about the fantasy realm.

00:01:14.245 --> 00:01:15.607
- Look around at the world right now.

00:01:15.607 --> 00:01:17.292
Who doesn't want to
escape that for a minute?

00:01:17.292 --> 00:01:18.563
- It's like a comfort world in the way

00:01:18.563 --> 00:01:22.167
that maybe like a family
sitcom is timeless themes.

00:01:22.167 --> 00:01:23.228
There's always gonna be elves.

00:01:23.228 --> 00:01:25.266
Or it's two-handed swords.

00:01:25.266 --> 00:01:28.000
- Who can't say that they
wish they could settle

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.167
an office dispute with a
two-sided ax now and then.

