00:02:26.993 --> 00:02:29.146
so don't be intimidated
when you see these dudes

00:02:29.146 --> 00:02:30.884
with these bodies, be like wait.

00:02:30.884 --> 00:02:32.796
- He has a man cobra trainer, for sure.

