bring a certain card out.

00:03:35.344 --> 00:03:36.303
- I have a question.

00:03:36.303 --> 00:03:37.664
An instant.

00:03:37.664 --> 00:03:39.119
Can an instant be played
during another person's turn?

00:03:39.119 --> 00:03:40.217
- [Man] Oh, absolutely.

00:03:40.217 --> 00:03:41.430
You can wreck him all you want.

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:42.263
- Making sure.

00:03:42.263 --> 00:03:43.278
- Once I got into it I was like

00:03:43.278 --> 00:03:46.114
oh, untap, tap, strategy.

00:03:46.114 --> 00:03:46.951
- Whip it out.

00:03:46.951 --> 00:03:48.845
- Yeah, attack her, beat her.

00:03:48.845 --> 00:03:49.678
All done.

00:03:49.678 --> 00:03:52.004
- But look at us, see we're
using all the Magic lingo.

00:03:52.004 --> 00:03:52.837
- Yeah, yeah.

00:03:52.837 --> 00:03:55.276
- Now we know what
people are talking about.

00:03:55.276 --> 00:03:57.004
- When someone starts
playing for the first time

00:03:57.004 --> 00:03:58.864
and they get this scope
of like what's going on

00:03:58.864 --> 00:04:01.667
and how deep you can go, it's
kind of like you can see it.

00:04:01.667 --> 00:04:03.369
And it's fun to see.

00:04:03.369 --> 00:04:04.292
- [Man] It's beautiful.

00:04:04.292 --> 00:04:05.962
Ooh, look at this foil.

00:04:05.962 --> 00:04:07.215
Look at that foil.

00:04:07.215 --> 00:04:08.292
- The art was beautiful.

00:04:08.292 --> 00:04:11.897
You can just tell how much
care went into every aspect,

00:04:11.897 --> 00:04:12.730
in every card.

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:15.331
- You just have this vision in your mind

00:04:15.331 --> 00:04:18.256
of what it's doing on the battle field.

00:04:18.256 --> 00:04:21.279
- I would say to people who
haven't tried Magic yet,

00:04:21.279 --> 00:04:22.812
don't be overwhelmed.

00:04:22.812 --> 00:04:24.480
Once you just start digesting

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:27.193
and actually seeing people
play it, it's super tangible

00:04:27.193 --> 00:04:29.076
and super accessible.

00:04:29.076 --> 00:04:31.689
- Being out there,
seeing all my coworkers,

00:04:31.689 --> 00:04:33.973
smelling the cards, feeling the sleeves.

00:04:33.973 --> 00:04:35.505
- You never lost the spark.

00:04:35.505 --> 00:04:36.338
- It was so much fun.

00:04:36.338 --> 00:04:37.711
I want to get better
and I want to play more.

00:04:37.711 --> 00:04:39.943
- Just like bust out my
deck, like "Lets go."

00:04:39.943 --> 00:04:41.973
- Lunch hour, here it is.

00:04:41.973 --> 00:04:43.199
(laughs)

